tails hair, she is always smiling.\n\nYou may pick any hair style of hers that you would prefer to draw. Please draw whatever you like! She also has two cat mascots if you'd like to draw that as well. \n\nI will use this for SNS and YouTube. Thank you!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1QALWIKjus0MxPxeqs5SzSoAZDzr0E7kB", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@mushi_buuun/works/4", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/2a0a79b4/uploads/origins/675c8e22-4b32-4cf9-bc3f-94cf616ecf81?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=51e4d87abf2abe1f3877c2f07bbc0afb", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2a0a79b4/uploads/origins/675c8e22-4b32-4cf9-bc3f-94cf616ecf81?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=51e4d87abf2abe1f3877c2f07bbc0afb, https://si.imgix.net/2a0a79b4/uploads/origins/675c8e22-4b32-4cf9-bc3f-94cf616ecf81?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9717d4063dfa5a3a28ef4ce7a2932e8a 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2a0a79b4/uploads/origins/675c8e22-4b32-4cf9-bc3f-94cf616ecf81?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e6988d8660f72a1a3eb7380cb0880845 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは、はじめまして。あなたの作品にとても惹かれています！\n\nルーシーちゃんを描いていただけませんか？内気で不器用な昆虫怪獣の女の子です。服装は複数ありますが、黒のナース服でお願いします。白目はグレー、瞳孔は赤とクリーム色です。\n\nあなたの構図はとても好きなので、お任せします。メランコリックな雰囲気であれば。何でも描いてください。\nご配慮ありがとうございましたm(_ _)m\n\nhttps://toyhou.se/22776529.lucy/26375651.outfit-refs", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@mushi_buuun/works/3", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/44129262/uploads/origins/1b3322d2-c9c1-4333-88cf-9e5ff3d1ce8b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=755b0d61634f7a2bdc886cb32c33cfb9", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/44129262/uploads/origins/1b3322d2-c9c1-4333-88cf-9e5ff3d1ce8b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=755b0d61634f7a2bdc886cb3